    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d608">

                <pb facs="0739" n="619" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg619"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Japanese
                    Minister.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-07-24"><hi rendition="#italic">July 24,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 210.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your note of the 20th instant, in which, under the instruction of your
                    government, you request this government to bring to the attention of the
                    Imperial Russian Government a violation of the Geneva convention of 1864,
                    alleged to have been committed by Russian cavalry on May 18 last.</p>
                <p>Copies of your note and its inclosure have been forwarded to the American
                    ambassador at St. Petersburg, and he has been instructed to transmit them to the
                    Russian foreign office.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
